meta {
  name: Invite links - Open
  type: http
  seq: 226
}

get {
  url: {{BASE_URL}}/api/v1/invite-links/<token of the link>
  body: none
  auth: none
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json
}

docs {
  What an invite link opens, for the person who has it (#1391): the community (its public shape, or the shape of a member for a member) and state: join, member or blocked (a manager removed you). Never the name of the link, its groups, its tags or its counts. A link that does not work (unknown, off, ended, full, deleted, of a personal community) gives one 404 with one message. 20 reads a minute. Token ability: communities:read.
}
